{"id":"n37212-2-7","stage":5,"title":"찌꺼기 · 渣滓","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37212-2-7-1","ko":"새우를 다듬고 남은 찌꺼기는 어떻게 할까?","zh":"处理完虾后剩下的残渣要怎么处理呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새우를","meaning":"虾","explanation":"새우：虾；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"새우","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63367","senseId":"1","lemma":"새우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새우를","audio":"/audio/8bae2999b4df3ead7a5d.mp3"}},{"text":"다듬고","meaning":"捋，修剪","explanation":"다듬다：捋，修剪；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"다듬다","audio":"/audio/2059f1bf5b0c608a75fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28344","senseId":"2","lemma":"다듬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다듬고","audio":"/audio/638ae934d2040efd16b9.mp3"}},{"text":"남은","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남은","audio":"/audio/0736fbdfe295646df99b.mp3"}},{"text":"찌꺼기는","meaning":"渣滓，残渣，废渣","explanation":"찌꺼기：渣滓，残渣，废渣；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"찌꺼기","audio":"/audio/52324bee7ea86ec13dae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37212","senseId":"2","lemma":"찌꺼기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌꺼기는","audio":"/audio/2033ef288072530eadcf.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"할까?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까","audio":"/audio/8f972208798a5637049f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fd7862fa6687a608","term":"새우","zh":"虾","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3","entryId":"63367","definition":"弯背长须多脚的水生小动物。","pronunciation":["새우"]},{"id":"2059f1bf5b0c608a","term":"다듬다","zh":"捋，修剪","audio":"/audio/2059f1bf5b0c608a75fc.mp3","entryId":"28344","definition":"修理到均匀的状态，十分好看。","pronunciation":["다듬따"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"52324bee7ea86ec1","term":"찌꺼기","zh":"渣滓，残渣，废渣","audio":"/audio/52324bee7ea86ec13dae.mp3","entryId":"37212","definition":"选出内容物中可用的或有价值的东西后剩余的东西。","pronunciation":["찌꺼기"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/87d2bf96a7a8e567c020.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37212-2-7-2","ko":"쓸데도 없으니까 그냥 버려.","zh":"反正也没用，直接扔掉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쓸데도","meaning":"用，使用；事情，东西。","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；데：事情，东西。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"},{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"2","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸데도","audio":"/audio/46c097770cac623f1842.mp3"}},{"text":"없으니까","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없으니까","audio":"/audio/995703f7577d3bfd7d95.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"버려.","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버려","audio":"/audio/ea27937a2fe196ccc20c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"事情，东西。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"事情，东西。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"扔，丢","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"65570","definition":"丢弃或倒掉没必要继续持有的东西。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/790bc49b9d5c53613b19.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.436,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37212","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2627,"questi